# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/2Rabbit.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Rabbit runs in perseverance II
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Sunday 19th February 1995 by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Compass:	Kevin Munn (compass now at the bottom of a rift in FAB)
# Tape:		Ali Garman
# Book:		Tim Long
# Data entry:	Tim Long

survey rabbitrun_add

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Kevin's compas is (was) precalibrated, so no need for any adjustment here.

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  data normal from to length compass clino
  s1	s2	2	-	up	# Short climb into passage
  s2	s3	5.5	286	0
  s3	s4	9.4	322	0
  s4	s5	4.6	284	-40	# Back to Perseverance

endcentreline
endsurvey
